# 8-Bit Full Adder

This project implements an **8-bit Full Adder using VHDL** by connecting eight 1-bit Full Adders in a **Ripple Carry** configuration.

### Inputs

* A (8-bit)
* B (8-bit)
* Cin

### Outputs

* Sum (8-bit)
* Cout

### Files

* `Full_adder.vhd` — 8-bit Full Adder
* `Fulladder.vhd` — Testbench
